/* 成就卡卡面（学习页横条、成就卡页网格、抽卡浮层共用）：顶部卡名标签 + 卡图；没上传卡图时画占位（主题色渐变 + 等级号）。 */
.ac-face {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  padding: 0 8rpx 8rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: var(--ac-color, #FD7C02);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.ac-face-tag {
  flex: none;
  height: 40rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.ac-face-art {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  background: #FFF8EE;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.ac-face-image {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.ac-face-placeholder {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55)), var(--ac-color, #FD7C02);
}

.ac-face-placeholder-title {
  color: var(--ac-color, #FD7C02);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
}

.ac-face-placeholder-no {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  color: rgba(36, 51, 45, 0.45);
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* 还没拿到：淡出 */
.ac-face-dim {
  opacity: 0.42;
}

.ac-badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: -12rpx;
  right: -12rpx;
  z-index: 2;
  min-width: 36rpx;
  height: 36rpx;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 3rpx solid #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #F04438;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 30rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

/* CSS 画的小锁（不放图标素材） */
.ac-lock {
  position: relative;
  width: 18rpx;
  height: 22rpx;
}
.ac-lock::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 3rpx;
  top: 0;
  width: 12rpx;
  height: 12rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 3rpx solid currentColor;
  border-bottom: none;
  border-radius: 8rpx 8rpx 0 0;
}
.ac-lock::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 18rpx;
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 3rpx;
  background: currentColor;
}
